width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #2B4789; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tPROP6">Proposal Six: Adjournment or Postponement of the Annual Meeting </a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #2B4789; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tPROP6">71</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tARE">Annual Report</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tARE">72</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAIN">Additional Information</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAIN">72</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tOBU">Other Business</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tOBU">73</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPA">Appendix&#160;A: Supplemental Financial Information Non-GAAP Measures</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPA">74</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPB">Appendix&#160;B: 2026 Plan</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; padding-bottom: 5.5pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPB">75</a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 432pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPC">Appendix&#160;C: Certificate of Amendment to the Certificate of Incorporation</a></div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 10.01pt; padding-top: 5.24pt; text-align: center; vertical-align: bottom; white-space: nowrap;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;"><a href="#tAPPC">89</a></div></td></tr><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 3pt; width: 432pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 40pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 3pt; width: 10.01pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr></table></div></div></div><div>
