</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 522pt;"><a id="ny20063868x2_def14a_108-cda_pg8"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 522pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 6pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">The table below illustrates the minimum, target, and maximum bonus amounts, expressed in dollars, potentially payable to our NEOs under the annual bonus plan, inclusive of bonus amounts attributable to realization of MBOs: </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 10pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;"> </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 288pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.44pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.44pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 28.9pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.44pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.44pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 28.9pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.44pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 22.4