ght: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">Target <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">($)</div></td><td style="width: 22.44pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 22.44pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 35.57pt; padding-bottom: 4.5pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: bottom; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">Maximum <br/></div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 6pt; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 0pt; text-align: right;">($) </div></td><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 288pt; padding-top: 4.27pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #2B4789; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 1.5pt; text-align: left;">David Meniane</div></td><td style="width: 22.44pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 22.44pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 28.9pt; padding-top: 4.27pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid 