</div><div class="BRDSX_page" style="text-align: left; margin: auto; line-height: initial; width: 522pt;"><a id="ny20063868x2_def14a_109-executive_pg4"><!--Anchor--></a><p style="text-align: left; font-family: 'Times New Roman', Times, Serif; font-size: 8pt; font-variant: normal; font-weight: bold"><a href="#TOC">TABLE OF CONTENTS</a></p><div class="BRDSX_page-content"><div class="BRDSX_block-main" style="width: 522pt; margin-left: 0pt;"><div class="BRDSX_h2" style="color: #58595B; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 8pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">Outstanding Equity Awards at Fiscal Year-End </div><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 9pt; margin-top: 3pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">The following table presents the outstanding equity awards held by each of the NEOs as of January&#160;3, 2026. </div><table cellpadding="0" class="BRDSX_fintab" style="border-spacing: 0; margin-top: 4pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789; width: 522pt; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;"><tr class="BRDSX_boxspacer"><td style="height: 6pt; width: 3pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 56pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 2pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 2pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 24pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td colspan="10" style="height: 6pt; width: 189.5pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 2pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 2pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 36.12pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="height: 6pt; width: 2pt;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#