ign: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 31.74pt; text-align: left;">698,000</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 56.86pt; padding-top: 4.27pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 21.29pt; text-align: left;">1,580,513</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 68.8pt; padding-top: 4.27pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 60.79pt; text-align: left;">&#8212;</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 15.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 35.57pt; padding-top: 4.27pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 0pt; text-align: left;">2,278,513 </div></td><td style="width: 3pt