er-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 68.71pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 39.81pt; text-align: left;">$60,339</div></td><td style="width: 20.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 20.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 48.69pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: 15.34pt; text-align: left;">$147,600</div></td><td style="width: 20.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 20.88pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 33.35pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: right; vertical-align: top; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #000000; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 8pt; margin-top: 0pt; margin-left: -0.01pt; text-align: left;">$207,939 </div></td><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td></tr><tr><td style="width: 3pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div style="font-size: 1pt;">&#8194;</div></td><td style="width: 240pt; padding-top: 3.9pt; padding-bottom: 4.13pt; text-align: left; vertical-align: top; border-bottom: 1pt solid #2B4789;"><div class="BRDSX_fpara" style="color: #2B4789; font-family: Arial, Hel